  "findings": {
    "CA2-C12-B01": "fixed: every module-level name bound exactly once (CA-SEAL names included); top_functions() refuses a second def wherever the checker builds a name map; the main guard must be the last module statement; the corpus checks that the imported module runs the one binding",
    "CA2-C12-B02": "fixed: every line of a function new since CA-SEAL is an inserted line, so every node there has a census or changed-line row; every other positioned node of V has a node row",
    "CA2-C12-N01": "fixed: line pins of the frozen validator; every inserted, changed, deleted or replaced line relative to it needs a reviewed record",
    "CA2-C12-N02": "fixed: the module body only declares; writes to module objects (directly, through aliases, from functions, lambdas, class bodies and comprehensions), mutating methods of module containers, import *, namespace builtins and unused dunders are refused before any row is read",
    "CA2-C12-N03": "fixed: arithmetic and set operators are census rows (no excluded class); reason text corrected",
    "CA2-C12-N04": "fixed: node_text() blanks only statement-list fields; Lambda and module-level IfExp controls",
    "CA2-C12-N05": "fixed: main's recount seam located from the AST; the parent assertion runs inside record(); insertion probes read the one binding"
  },
